| erp_invoice_cron | Python | Internal ERP data collection automation. Since there's no API endpoint, it uses macros to retrieve data and store it in a database. |
| local_ai | — | AI agent development and experiments. Notes on my four personal Hermes agents, local machines, and AI models. |
| MJtoolkit | TypeScript, Python | Internal SCM management web portal integrated with the supplier portal and ERP system. |
| MorePartyViewSlots-12slot | C | Personal modification of a WotR mod to support 12 party slots. Became obsolete when Party Bar Unbound came out. Party Bar Unbound is so much better. Wish it had come out sooner! |
| Office_Automation | Python | Collection of macros for automating office tasks at work. |
| outs1.0 | Python | Inventory management application distributed for free to subcontractors without their own inventory management systems. |
| Pokemon Another Red_PWT_250821 | — | Personal modification of a Pokémon fan game. |
| portfolio | Python | Personal investment portfolio management and analysis application. |
| Production_Scheduling | Python | Production scheduling and workload allocation optimization tool. |
| resolution | Python | Screen resolution switching macro. |
| supplier-portal | TypeScript, Python | SCM web application for real-time coordination, management, finalization of delivery schedules, and communication with subcontractors. Runs separately from the internal corporate network and integrates with MJtoolkit and the ERP system. |
| Thrallherd | C#, Python | Personal class mod for Pathfinder: Wrath of the Righteous, built on the Psionic framework. |
| Eldritch | C# | Custom WotR class mod built from scratch. A level 1–20 class featuring Demon, Azata, Aeon, and Trickster paths, with a pseudo-mythic progression system using the `1+(x-1)` level formula. |
| AutoLevelUp | C#, Python | Automatic level-up build mod for Pathfinder: Wrath of the Righteous. |
| tlancelate | Python | `translate.py` — Automatic translation of the ETW DarthMod using the Claude API. |

